rooms_desc ({"You see large  and  wunderful entrance hall  of  Lord Silver's house.Ancient statues all along the walls add respect to that place and youhardly dare to break that silence which envelopes you here. Warm  redcarpet covers the floor and you enjoy its softness. You feel like youhave been here before. Might  be  old paintings on the ceiling wouldhelp you to remember.","You can see a strange chair and table on the western side and old bookcase on eastern side of the room.","It will be a living room in future. For two people not just forSilver so it is like it is now because he doesn`t know  anyoneto share it with.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","Well this place is supposed to be bedroom ...  *sniff*","Its room supposed to be sauna in color of sea, with hot tube and ....Waiting to be decored aswell.",0,0,0,})
